    values:originalText "The repeal of sections 56CC and 56CD of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 by this Part applies in relation to acts or omissions on or after the commencement of this Part.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Changes to the Privacy safeguards  Part 6 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024" ;
