    skos:definition "Insert: ; and (e) if a small business operator (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988) is an action service provider for a type of CDR action, the Privacy Act 1988 applies: (i) subject to paragraphs (ab) to (c) of this subsection; and (ii) in relation to personal information disclosed to the provider under the consumer data rules; as if the provider were an organisation (within the meaning of the Privacy Act 1988)."@en ;
