concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-93 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "93 Subsection 56ED(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-93 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Changes to the Privacy safeguards  Part 6 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024 Object (1) The object of this section is to ensure that each person (a CDR entity) who: (a) is a data holder of CDR data; or (b) is an accredited person who is or who may become an accredited data recipient of CDR data; or (c) is a designated gateway for CDR data; or (d) as an action service provider for a type of CDR action, has been or may be disclosed CDR data under the consumer data rules; manages the CDR data in an open and transparent way." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Changes to the Privacy safeguards  Part 6 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024 Object (1) The object of this section is to ensure that each person (a CDR entity) who: (a) is a data holder of CDR data; or (b) is an accredited person who is or who may become an accredited data recipient of CDR data; or (c) is a designated gateway for CDR data; or (d) as an action service provider for a type of CDR action, has been or may be disclosed CDR data under the consumer data rules; manages the CDR data in an open and transparent way."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "92afffec9b0fe2590640957eda765e7c235618f19e1d1bd2c02b48748a2fa169" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ensure open and transparent management of CDR data" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf> ;
