concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-135 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "135 Transitional—current Data Recipient Accreditor"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-135 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An appointment: (a) under subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and (b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part; continues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after that commencement, as if it were an appointment of the CDR Accreditor under that subsection as amended by this Part. (2) A thing done by, or in relation to, the Data Recipient Accreditor under the CDR provisions before that commencement has effect, on and after that commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the CDR Accreditor. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An appointment: (a) under subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; and (b) in force immediately before the commencement of this Part; continues in force (and may be dealt with), on and after that commencement, as if it were an appointment of the CDR Accreditor under that subsection as amended by this Part. (2) A thing done by, or in relation to, the Data Recipient Accreditor under the CDR provisions before that commencement has effect, on and after that commencement, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the CDR Accreditor. However, this is not taken to change the time at which the thing was actually done."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8992b30f750fcc448226c89cd06cb4700c58b98c975a50c1c22703cdce6a44ef" ;
    cof:pageNumber "53"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Continues existing appointment of CDR Accreditor under amended subsection 56CG(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf> ;
    dc:source "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.53" ;
    cml:asserts concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-135-norm .
