concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-163 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "163 Transitional—existing declarations of participating"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-163 ;
    values:originalText "government entities of a State or Territory A declaration under subsection 56AS(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 in force immediately before the commencement of this Part continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if that declaration: (a) had been made under that subsection as substituted by this Part; and (b) had declared the applicable entity as a participating entity, for the applicable State or Territory, in the capacity as a data holder of CDR data." ;
    skos:definition "government entities of a State or Territory A declaration under subsection 56AS(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 in force immediately before the commencement of this Part continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if that declaration: (a) had been made under that subsection as substituted by this Part; and (b) had declared the applicable entity as a participating entity, for the applicable State or Territory, in the capacity as a data holder of CDR data."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6ecf667f360cda62664f7d4e36b46e61dccd38331513b2f57451ab5089edf3ac" ;
