concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-175 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "175 After subsection 56FD(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-175 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (2A) A contract is taken to be in force between: (a) an action service provider for a type of CDR action to which a binding data standard applies; and (b) each accredited action initiator for a CDR action of that type; under which each of those persons: (c) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard applies to the person; and (d) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in. Note: This means the action service provider will be taken to have a separate contract with each of those accredited action initiators.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous amendments  Part 8 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (2A) A contract is taken to be in force between: (a) an action service provider for a type of CDR action to which a binding data standard applies; and (b) each accredited action initiator for a CDR action of that type; under which each of those persons: (c) agrees to observe the standard to the extent that the standard applies to the person; and (d) agrees to engage in conduct that the person is required by the standard to engage in. Note: This means the action service provider will be taken to have a separate contract with each of those accredited action initiators.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous amendments  Part 8 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c919fa4911665e466e8592976ab3310fc3fc8fd095cce1a4531c53a980a36ad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines contract force between action service provider and accredited initiators under a binding data standard." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf> ;
    dc:source "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024.pdf, p.60" ;
    cml:asserts concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-175-norm .
