concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-182 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "182 Subsection 56GD(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-182 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous amendments  Part 8 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024 (2) The Commission may, by written notice given to a person, exempt the person in relation to: (a) particular CDR data or one or more classes of CDR data; or (b) a particular CDR action or one or more types of CDR actions; from all or specified provisions covered by this section." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Amendments  Schedule 1 Miscellaneous amendments  Part 8 No. 75, 2024 Treasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2024 (2) The Commission may, by written notice given to a person, exempt the person in relation to: (a) particular CDR data or one or more classes of CDR data; or (b) a particular CDR action or one or more types of CDR actions; from all or specified provisions covered by this section."@en ;
