concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2024-sch-1-sec-56gf-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "56GF(5) Application of the CDR provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-56gf-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) In this section: ICCPR means the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights, done at New York on 16 December 1966, as amended and in force for Australia from time to time. Note: The text of the International Covenant is set out in Australian Treaty Series 1980 No. 23 ([1980] ATS 23). In 2024, the text of a Covenant  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(5) In this section: ICCPR means the International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights, done at New York on 16 December 1966, as amended and in force for Australia from time to time. Note: The text of the International Covenant is set out in Australian Treaty Series 1980 No. 23 ([1980] ATS 23). In 2024, the text of a Covenant  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
